data parse_table_memo_seed_handler_dissolution_trigger: String = "🟡 SCAFFOLD (§7 seed-retained, retire-with-seed): v1_interpreter.rs parse_table_materialization_allows_memo + try_parse_table_memo_dispatch gate ctx.parse_table_memo on modeled ParseTable.materialization == Memoize (v2.compiler materialization_allows_memo_store is the .dag authority; governed door witnesses in parse_table_memo_governed_witness_test.dag). Case-A receipt (merry-moth-539, 2026-07-10): non-Memoize tables must not populate or serve the seed ParseTableMemo accelerator — insert ran before the governed door and lookup served memo hits, flipping door observables order-dependently; fixed by gating map insert/serve on Memoize only (after call_function on insert). NOT a v1→std migration target per duplicate-work-graph-lens-design.md section 10b operator ruling (compiler-internal seed mechanisms = countable inventory). DISSOLVES WHEN std.realization.reconcile-as-lookup-path lands — v2.compiler cached_stage_governed runtime dispatch replaces the seed-side memo interceptor (materialization_carriers.dag follow-on / ROADMAP duplicate-work-graph-lens section 10b)."

